Then a voice began to echo through the dusty streets, a voice that would change

31
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:08,360
the destiny of humanity: "Jesus of Nazareth." With words of love, compassion, and forgiveness, he touched the

32
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:17,040
hearts of many. But his message also challenged the established power. And because of that, his voice aroused

33
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:26,180
opposition. Jesus was arrested, tried, and forced to carry his cross through the streets of the city.

34
00:04:26,180 --> 00:04:29,320
... It was atop

35
