a hill called Golgotha ​​that his journey came to an end: he was crucified between two other men.

36
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:42,920
Three days later, his disciples saw that he had risen.

37
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:49,040
That moment not only changed the faith of those who followed him, but it forever transformed the course

38
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:54,040
of human history. ...

39
00:04:55,520 --> 00:05:02,400
The place where Jesus is believed to have been crucified and buried became the Church of the Holy

40
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:10,360
Sepulchre. Inside this church, the atmosphere is enveloped in silence. Pilgrims approach

41
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:17,480
the Stone of Anointing, kneel, and touch the spot where, according to tradition, his body was

42
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:21,840
