meaningful room. It is there that the Last Supper is said to have taken place,

45
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:47,200
Jesus' final meeting with his disciples before his arrest. A moment of intimacy and revelation that still

46
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:51,320
resonates in the liturgy and Christian memory today. ...

47
00:05:56,640 --> 00:06:05,880
In 638 AD, the city saw the arrival of Muslim armies, marking the beginning

48
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:12,920
