49
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:22,280
According to Islamic tradition, it was from Jerusalem that the Prophet Muhammad ascended to

50
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:30,560
heaven on a divine journey, departing from a sacred rock on the Temple Mount. To commemorate

51
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:37,240
