52
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:41,200
the "Dome of the Rock." ...

53
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:53,600
Its golden dome shines over the Old City like a beacon of faith, visible from almost every

54
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:58,520
corner of the city. ...

55
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:05,600
And just as its dome rises toward the sky, the streets of the Old City

56
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:11,360
wind between the stones, laden with centuries of devotion and encounters.

57
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:15,880
sacred. ...

58
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:23,600
Today, the Old City of Jerusalem presents itself as an intricate mosaic

59
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:30,440
of cultures and religions. It is divided into four distinct neighborhoods: the Jewish Quarter,

60
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:37,400
with the Wailing Wall and historic synagogues; the Christian Quarter, where the Church

61
