103
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:36,440
and "The Dove in a Bulletproof Vest." These works question violence, occupation, and the

104
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:43,360
yearning for freedom. With humor and poetry, he critiques the violence and injustices in the region.

105
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:49,960
Banksy also created the "Walled Off Hotel," a hotel built right next to the

106
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:57,560
Israeli separation wall. The site became famous for deliberately offering "the worst view in the world,"

107
00:12:57,560 --> 00:13:05,520
with the aim of exposing visitors to the difficult local reality. Thus, in Bethlehem, even the

108
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:11,720
