125
00:15:11,060 --> 00:15:15,960
...This place is a living testament

126
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:23,120
to the resilience of faith amid the harsh conditions of the desert and one of the most

127
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:29,760
iconic locations for those seeking to learn about the spiritual history of the Holy Land. And while

128
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:37,360
silence shaped refuges of faith like Mar Saba, further out in the desert something even

129
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:43,000
